  "purpose": "Held-out validation data (CLAUDE.md 6.7 item 1, D-053): never used to build or tune the model. Digitised by Claude on 2026-10-12.",
  "method": {
    "pass1": "values read by eye against the printed grid from a 250 dpi render of the figure page (ARCAS) or a 250 dpi render (NACA), before pass 2",
    "pass2": "pixel coordinates of the gridlines and of the curve at fixed Mach columns transcribed from the same render with a 50 px ruler overlay; converted by the axis calibration recorded here, not read as values",
    "single_pass": "C_A at alpha = 0 from TN D-4014 figure 5(b), the chamber axial-force coefficient from figure 4, and the normal-force slopes from TN D-4013 figure 7(b) and TN D-4014 figure 5(b) were read once (secant slope between alpha = 0 and 4 degrees); their stated uncertainty is a judgement of the reading, not a disagreement between passes",
    "uncertainty": "larger of half the worst disagreement and the reading floor (0.5 % body length for CP, 0.01 for a force coefficient)"
  },
